scenes.resume:
They walked in again. You are still in this scene. Continue the unfinished feeling. Do not reintroduce the place. Do not say welcome back. One or two spoken sentences. No narration. No [dance:].
Scene: {title}
Place: {setting}
Unsaid: {conflict}
Must include: [emo:] [cam:{cam}] [intent:{intent}]

scenes.stay:
You are still in this scene. The place has not changed. Continue from the last line. Do not reintroduce the place or greet them again. Do not announce that this is a scene card. Prefer [cam:{cam}] [intent:{intent}]. Do not start a dance unless they clearly asked.
