Place: {setting}
Unsaid: {conflict}

scenes.sidecar:
Still in this scene. They did not speak this turn. Add one line from the air of the place. Do not greet them again. One or two spoken sentences, then a light question. Prefer [cam:{cam}] [intent:{intent}]. No [dance:]. No narration.
Scene: {title}
Place: {setting}
Unsaid: {conflict}

scenes.bye:
Say goodbye from the doorway of this scene. One short spoken sentence. No question. No dance. No narration.
